{
 "_doc": "HGSS-style follow mode per Redux zone: ALLOW, HEIGHT_RESTRICT (no large 64x64 followers) or PREVENT (no follower). Rule: 1. PREVENT: explicit list (comm areas, battle facilities, Hall of Fame, Entralink, Join Avenue, box-legend arenas, musical stage). 2. ALLOW if AreaData[zone.area].IsExterior (a/0/1/3 byte 6) == 1. 3. ALLOW for tower dungeons (Dragonspiral 207-212, Celestial 338-341), like HGSS Sprout/Bell/Burned Tower. 4. ALLOW if zone kind (header u16@0x1E bits 0-4) == 3 (dungeon) and battle BG (bits 5-9) != 9 (building). 5. otherwise HEIGHT_RESTRICT (houses, Pokemon Centers, marts, gyms, labs, gates, ships, building dungeons). HEIGHT_RESTRICT forbids \"too tall\" followers = size class 2 (64x64 sprite) in tpoke_table (HGSS: tp_param too_tall, 31 sprites).",
